Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:0:00:25.77,WhisprsWatermark,,0,0,0,,@Whisprs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.11,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's late, and the\Nworld is finally quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.57,0:00:06.31,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If nobody told you\Ntoday, you did good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.81,0:00:09.40,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You survived things you\Nnever thought you could,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.58,0:00:11.10,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and you are still standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.67,0:00:13.18,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Take off the heavy armor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.44,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Turn down the noise\Nin your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.88,0:00:19.40,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Tonight, you don't have to\Nprove anything to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.02,0:00:22.62,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Let the world spin without\Nyou for a few hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:24.46,WhisprsItalic,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're going to be okay.
